  "notes": [
    "Dimensions and controls: archive.org snapshot (2008-12-26) of Nintendo JP's Wii controllers page (nintendo.co.jp/wii/controllers/index.html), section [RVL-003] — the original Wii Remote; today's live page shows the Remote Plus instead. Axis mapping as labelled: 縦 148mm = height, 横 36.2mm = width, 厚さ 30.8mm = depth, 突起部分を除く → excludes_projections true (the spaces are full-width, as printed). 操作部 list: pointer, 3-axis motion sensor, 本体の電源スイッチ, Ａ・Ｂ・十字, −・Home・＋, １・２ → dpad 1, face_button 4 (A, B, 1, 2 — the page does not say where B sits; it is the underside trigger, but a position is not sourced, so all four are filed as face_button), button 4 (power, −, HOME, +). Pointer and motion sensor are not controls. ports: «拡張ユニット接続可能» (expansion unit connectable) = expansion_slot 1, the only connector the spec names. その他の機能 also lists vibration, speaker and player indicator (no kinds). The web spec page publishes no mass. cell_kind aa from the live wiiRemote.html image alt text (AA alkaline cells included for checking operation); cell_count not printed (null). released = the white model's 発売日 on the same live page (alt text). host_console from the 2008 page title."
